<title>USA: TENNIS-ACURA CLASSIC WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ACURA CLASSIC WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MANHATTAN BEACH, California 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $450,000 Acura Classic women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Anne-Gaelle Sidot</p>
<p>(France) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>2-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Sandrine Testud (France) 6-7 (6-8)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4) 6-3</p>
<p>Amy Frazier (U.S.) beat 3-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) 6-1</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>4-Lindsey Davenport (U.S.) beat Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) 6-1</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Nathasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania)</p>
<p>6-2 4-6 7-6 (7-4)</p>
</text>
